      "content": "hey so i was watching that recent interview with leo dicaprio where he was talking about the new project... and i swear something was totally off. like around the 4:12 mark his left eye blinked but his right one stayed still for way too long and it looked almost robotic. have u ever seen anything like that in his old clips? it felt super uncanny",
