    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know... it didnt feel like fatigue. it felt more like a lag. and i noticed it again in that red carpet clip from last week where his hand movements were just... slightly out of sync with his speech. like there was a delay. if it was just muscle weakness wouldn't it be more consistent? the way it happens in these weird, sudden bursts feels way more like a software error or something. does that even make sense?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
